[00:05.09]Ben:
[00:05.09]Is it that bad?
[00:06.71]Ami:
[00:06.81]No, it's lovely. It's just…
[00:10.75]Ben:
[00:10.85]I painted it from memory - well, of course I did, you weren't actually here - but now I look at it, you're different.
[00:18.37]Maybe it's just because you've got your hair up. I don't know...
[00:21.00]Ami:
[00:22.00]Every line
[00:24.50]Every stroke, every shade,
[00:27.00]Every curve...
[00:32.23]It's as if I'm staring at a photograph
[00:37.10]Almost like he had a camera on the hill
[00:40.87]Three years ago
[00:42.70]Our hill...
[00:44.76]Three years...
[00:50.76]Though he may not remember this picture paints a window to the way we were,
[01:02.18]How once we were.
[01:05.20]Is this the way back in?
[01:09.20]Back to what could have been?
[01:13.30]Letting the truth begin this time.
[01:21.40]Ben?
[01:23.23]Ben:
[01:23.33]Yeah?
[01:24.60]Ami:
[01:24.70]There's something I've been wanting to tell you...
[01:26.30]Ben:
[01:26.40]Oww! Sorry.
[01:29.30]Ami:
[01:29.40]My god, what's the matter?
[01:31.00]Ben:
[01:31.10]It's nothing... Just a - ****! - these last few days, I've been getting these headaches.
[01:36.35]Ami:
[01:36.45]Like after the accident?
[01:38.14]Ben:
[01:38.24]Not that bad, no.
[01:38.07]Ami:
[01:39.07]Why didn't you tell me?
[01:39.14]Ben:
[01:40.14]Honestly, it's just a twinge.
[01:41.10]Ami:
[01:41.20]It looks like more than a twinge! Are you all right?
[01:43.38]Ben:
[01:43.48]Agh!
[01:44.10]Ami:
[01:44.20]That's it, I'm calling your doctor.
[01:45.50]Ben:
[01:45.60]It's all right, I'll do it.
[01:49.87]Ami:
[01:49.97]How can I tell him who I am
[01:52.25]When, if I do, the pain will grow
[01:54.00]Until the pain can never go
[01:58.10]So can I really risk it all?
[02:02.00]Are there some lines we shouldn't cross?
[02:05.20]Where is the balance between truth and loss?
[02:10.45]Take it slow, Ami.
[02:15.25]Take it slow.
[02:22.55]But this picture
[02:27.00]Of that late afternoon
[02:31.00]As the sun started setting
[02:34.00]And there was nothing but you.
[02:38.45]Nothing but me happy...
[02:46.25]In our place
[02:51.50]Secret and unknown
[02:54.30]Somewhere only we would go.
[02:58.75]Lost in love,
[03:01.49]Sharing dreams.
[03:04.00]We had never felt so free...
